==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
*15 [[Li'l Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Dolphina]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Most melee attackers are able to deal with this stage nicely. As long as Dolphina is kept away from the base and the Dagshunds swiftly dealt with, there should be little risk of losing here. Thunderbolt is good to keep the enemies at bay while melee units do their work.

